      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "I had a few personal recommendations for Mildura Solar so I chose them over another local installer. The sales bloke was very informative and showed me their monitoring web portal and talked about my needs. Once the deposit was paid, the communication was a bit lacking. It took me a few phone calls to find out that my install date would be postponed by 6 weeks due to inverter shortages. I had to call them to get updates and information which I thought was a bit poor. Come installation date, they started installing the rails on one side of the roof instead of east and west like I had discussed initially. Luckily it was caught before they put the panels on, but it was due to a break down in internal communication. Post install it looks good on the roof, a nice tidy installation and fit off for the inverter.",
